./mir

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ RelocationKind is U32

` What an object relocation patches: the target of a `bl` or `b`, the page of an `adrp`, the low
` 12 bits of a page offset in an `add` or in a load or store of each access size, or a 64-bit
` address in data.

| call26-relocation = 0
| jump26-relocation = 1
| page21-relocation = 2
| add-pageoff12-relocation = 3
| load-store8-pageoff12-relocation = 4
| load-store16-pageoff12-relocation = 5
| load-store32-pageoff12-relocation = 6
| load-store64-pageoff12-relocation = 7
| load-store128-pageoff12-relocation = 8
| unsigned-relocation = 9

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ Relocation is Tuple

+ offset U32
+ symbol StringId
+ kind RelocationKind

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ load-store-pageoff12-relocation RelocationKind
    - size U32

` The page offset relocation of a load or store of `size` bytes.
?! Panic("No page offset relocation for a ${size}-byte access")
    if size != 1 && size != 2 && size != 4 && size != 8 && size != 16

match size
    |= 1
        .load-store8-pageoff12-relocation
    |= 2
        .load-store16-pageoff12-relocation
    |= 4
        .load-store32-pageoff12-relocation
    |= 8
        .load-store64-pageoff12-relocation
    ??
        .load-store128-pageoff12-relocation

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ is-branch26-relocation Bool
    - kind RelocationKind

kind == .call26-relocation || kind == .jump26-relocation
